(4539887, 654778, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Love the lighting on the subject and colored lights and smoke in background. Nice composition to leave negative space on left. Interesting overall color and contrast... subject looks a little desaturated or something which I like. Well done although I''m marking down slightly because the "tilted head" is a bit of a stretch for this challenge.</td>', 'Great shot. Love the lighting on the subject and colored lights and smoke in background. Nice composition to leave negative space on left. Interesting overall color and contrast... subject looks a little desaturated or something which I like. Well done although I''m marking down slightly because the "tilted head" is a bit of a stretch for this challenge.', '2008-03-05 07:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4539891, 654520, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great way to take an ordinary scene and make it interesting. Lighting is perfect. Love the warm tones. Tilt definitely gives it motion and energy. Love it!</td>', 'Great way to take an ordinary scene and make it interesting. Lighting is perfect. Love the warm tones. Tilt definitely gives it motion and energy. Love it!', '2008-03-05 07:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
