(4539899, 653607, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Not sure I get why there''s a pot out in the street but still interesting. I like the blurred person under the pot. Poles on sides have nice texture and frame the pot.</td>', 'Interesting. Not sure I get why there''s a pot out in the street but still interesting. I like the blurred person under the pot. Poles on sides have nice texture and frame the pot.', '2008-03-05 07:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
