(4541724, 654631, 90658, '<td valign="top">A straight 90 degree turn, while interesting when you determine how the world views your photograph, is not that interesting when the world determines how it is viewed.  If I saw this in a store I would turn it to the right and put everything back on the horizontal.</td>', 'A straight 90 degree turn, while interesting when you determine how the world views your photograph, is not that interesting when the world determines how it is viewed.  If I saw this in a store I would turn it to the right and put everything back on the horizontal.', '2008-03-05 19:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4541728, 654404, 90658, '<td valign="top">Now this is interesting.  You''ve got a downward, upsidedownish tilt going.  No matter how I turn my head, I cannot bring this back to a vertical.  Thank you.</td>', 'Now this is interesting.  You''ve got a downward, upsidedownish tilt going.  No matter how I turn my head, I cannot bring this back to a vertical.  Thank you.', '2008-03-05 19:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
