(4541733, 654252, 90658, '<td valign="top">I feel that this is more of a basic vanishing line shot.  The colors are spectacular and the cross hatch of the beams with the vertical is great, and you have done a nice job capturing it.  I just see the tilt.</td>', 'I feel that this is more of a basic vanishing line shot.  The colors are spectacular and the cross hatch of the beams with the vertical is great, and you have done a nice job capturing it.  I just see the tilt.', '2008-03-05 19:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
