(4541747, 652901, 56539, '<td valign="top">Colorful, but from an unusual angle.  With so many things in the photo plus the angle, I don''t know what you are trying to show</td>', 'Colorful, but from an unusual angle.  With so many things in the photo plus the angle, I don''t know what you are trying to show', '2008-03-05 19:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
