(4541757, 654768, 90658, '<td valign="top">It''s always different to take a picture facing straight up, and having someone upside down above you adds some fun.  But, this is very snap-shottish.  Good attempt, though.</td>', 'It''s always different to take a picture facing straight up, and having someone upside down above you adds some fun.  But, this is very snap-shottish.  Good attempt, though.', '2008-03-05 19:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4541761, 654632, 56539, '<td valign="top">Your photo meets the challenge, but I''m sorry, it has nothing to grab me with.</td>', 'Your photo meets the challenge, but I''m sorry, it has nothing to grab me with.', '2008-03-05 19:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4541765, 654783, 90658, '<td valign="top">I would have like to see this set-up with the snow on the straight horizontal.  There is nothing new about someone skiing downhill, but skking flat with the flags being all wonky...now that''s tilted.</td>', 'I would have like to see this set-up with the snow on the straight horizontal.  There is nothing new about someone skiing downhill, but skking flat with the flags being all wonky...now that''s tilted.', '2008-03-05 19:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4541767, 652811, 90658, '<td valign="top">A reverse tilt would have been better.  The path moves to the left as does the tunnel.  By tilting the shot to the right, I actually feel as if motion has stopped.</td>', 'A reverse tilt would have been better.  The path moves to the left as does the tunnel.  By tilting the shot to the right, I actually feel as if motion has stopped.', '2008-03-05 19:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4541770, 654113, 56539, '<td valign="top">You have got to make it easy on we voters. I don'';t know what this is a photo of.</td>', 'You have got to make it easy on we voters. I don'';t know what this is a photo of.', '2008-03-05 19:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4541775, 653525, 90658, '<td valign="top">OK!  If I turn my monitor over 180 degrees it becomes a straight shot of beer being poured.  Meaning if I saw this in a store, I would turn it over and say "it''s a shot of beer."  While you forcing me to look at it this way is intriguing, I don''t get the tilt.  Perhaps if the glass was on the horizontal on the left and there was some refernece point that "vertical" was a different direction, you would succeed in "tilting" the motion to have the beer being poured up.</td>', 'OK!  If I turn my monitor over 180 degrees it becomes a straight shot of beer being poured.  Meaning if I saw this in a store, I would turn it over and say "it''s a shot of beer."  While you forcing me to look at it this way is intriguing, I don''t get the tilt.  Perhaps if the glass was on the horizontal on the left and there was some refernece point that "vertical" was a different direction, you would succeed in "tilting" the motion to have the beer being poured up.', '2008-03-05 20:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
