(4541780, 653762, 90658, '<td valign="top">There is now different "tilt" to this.  I see the tilt in the fin, but the challenge was to show motion or design by tilt.  Not a bad shot of an aquarium, though.</td>', 'There is now different "tilt" to this.  I see the tilt in the fin, but the challenge was to show motion or design by tilt.  Not a bad shot of an aquarium, though.', '2008-03-05 20:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
