(4542459, 652899, 53316, '<td valign="top">Awww, yay! Piggy!  If it were me, I think I''d sharpen this up a bit and maybe make the yellow a bit brighter for a bolder look.  Hope your piggy enjoyed the carrots!!!</td>', 'Awww, yay! Piggy!  If it were me, I think I''d sharpen this up a bit and maybe make the yellow a bit brighter for a bolder look.  Hope your piggy enjoyed the carrots!!!', '2008-03-06 02:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542464, 653046, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh! This.... oh.  This is so.... amazingly wonderful... and..... oh my goodness.  It''s beyond me to say if the math is right, but if it is, you totally need to market this.  Some form of poster, or book cover, or.... yeah.  Man, I am so IMPRESSED with this!  (I''d prefer, in advanced, for the white lines at the top left, and less so but maybe also the bottom left, to be cloned out, but that really doesn''t detract for me, just a nit-pick.)</td>', 'Oh! This.... oh.  This is so.... amazingly wonderful... and..... oh my goodness.  It''s beyond me to say if the math is right, but if it is, you totally need to market this.  Some form of poster, or book cover, or.... yeah.  Man, I am so IMPRESSED with this!  (I''d prefer, in advanced, for the white lines at the top left, and less so but maybe also the bottom left, to be cloned out, but that really doesn''t detract for me, just a nit-pick.)', '2008-03-06 02:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542465, 654043, 53316, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  Absolutely gorgeous.  This is what happens when rainbows fall from the sky into cities and go on living.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  Absolutely gorgeous.  This is what happens when rainbows fall from the sky into cities and go on living.', '2008-03-06 02:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
