(4542720, 653244, 81382, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but a few technical issues. Very dark image and pretty much all of the few highlights are blown out which is a shame.</td>', 'Nice idea but a few technical issues. Very dark image and pretty much all of the few highlights are blown out which is a shame.', '2008-03-06 08:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542725, 652538, 81382, '<td valign="top">Small image, why not resize to 640. Nice long exposure effects but it is not obvious on first inspection, the eye is not quickly drawn to it and much of the image area is unoccuppied. A tighter crop on the moving traffic (and not obscured by trees) would have been more effective. Apart from the tilted crop/camera angle, there is nothing in the subject or scene this is itself tilted.</td>', 'Small image, why not resize to 640. Nice long exposure effects but it is not obvious on first inspection, the eye is not quickly drawn to it and much of the image area is unoccuppied. A tighter crop on the moving traffic (and not obscured by trees) would have been more effective. Apart from the tilted crop/camera angle, there is nothing in the subject or scene this is itself tilted.', '2008-03-06 08:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542726, 653490, 81382, '<td valign="top">Not particularly sharp, blown out highlights and washed out colours. Apart from the tilted crop/camera angle, there is nothing in the subject or scene that is tilted.</td>', 'Not particularly sharp, blown out highlights and washed out colours. Apart from the tilted crop/camera angle, there is nothing in the subject or scene that is tilted.', '2008-03-06 08:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
