(4542856, 652134, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this a couple of times now, and just now noticed the person leaning over the railing.  I wondered where are all the fishermen were.  :-)<br/> <br/>With or without the person at the railing this image works very well for the challenge IMO.  The slight tilt adds to the curve and brings the viewer around and into the photo.  The lined up fishing poles add rhythm.  The railing shadows assist the leading lines, and the gull in motion adds a dynamic to this.<br/> <br/>Nicely seen and captured!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''ve looked at this a couple of times now, and just now noticed the person leaning over the railing.  I wondered where are all the fishermen were.  :-) With or without the person at the railing this image works very well for the challenge IMO.  The slight tilt adds to the curve and brings the viewer around and into the photo.  The lined up fishing poles add rhythm.  The railing shadows assist the leading lines, and the gull in motion adds a dynamic to this. Nicely seen and captured!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-03-06 09:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
