(4543248, 654285, 26001, '<td valign="top">this shot is excellent on so many levels. the best thing is the brilliant use of lens distortion. it makes the tree look straight (parallel to the frame) even after the camera tilt. the only minor nitpick is (9 points VS 10 points sort), it would have been nice to have the left corner of the building included. very very well done!</td>', 'this shot is excellent on so many levels. the best thing is the brilliant use of lens distortion. it makes the tree look straight (parallel to the frame) even after the camera tilt. the only minor nitpick is (9 points VS 10 points sort), it would have been nice to have the left corner of the building included. very very well done!', '2008-03-06 12:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543253, 654648, 26001, '<td valign="top">"up up and away" would have been a catchier title. <br/>i guess her eyes are closed because of the "warp" speed hehehe. like the idea very much. not so impressed with the exposure though.</td>', '"up up and away" would have been a catchier title. i guess her eyes are closed because of the "warp" speed hehehe. like the idea very much. not so impressed with the exposure though.', '2008-03-06 12:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543263, 654650, 26001, '<td valign="top">nice idea. like the details of model''s pose, especially stance and flexing forearm muscles, as if he is really hanging/climbing.<br/>i am surprised when i did not see more shots in this genre in the challenge. removal of some distracting elements from the background (corner of the window, arch, something on top-right corner, and especially chair) could have enhanced this shot tremendously. good try nonetheless.</td>', 'nice idea. like the details of model''s pose, especially stance and flexing forearm muscles, as if he is really hanging/climbing.i am surprised when i did not see more shots in this genre in the challenge. removal of some distracting elements from the background (corner of the window, arch, something on top-right corner, and especially chair) could have enhanced this shot tremendously. good try nonetheless.', '2008-03-06 12:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543265, 654725, 26001, '<td valign="top">a postcard perfect picture of Coit tower. i like it, especially the saturated yellows and blues.</td>', 'a postcard perfect picture of Coit tower. i like it, especially the saturated yellows and blues.', '2008-03-06 12:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543271, 654666, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is a shot that would have been more effective on the horizontal.  The fact that she is going downhill is a given, what if she were presented as facing uphill or like I suggested...the snow being flat, her body then would be tilted out of center.  It causes an optical illusion and is really impressive.</td>', 'This is a shot that would have been more effective on the horizontal.  The fact that she is going downhill is a given, what if she were presented as facing uphill or like I suggested...the snow being flat, her body then would be tilted out of center.  It causes an optical illusion and is really impressive.', '2008-03-06 12:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543272, 654785, 90658, '<td valign="top">I''d like a little more tilt.  Not a lot, just enough to make it look like he''s fighting to stay in the chair, perhaps 5-15 more degrees.  Don''t go full 45, though, a diagonal would not do this shot justice.</td>', 'I''d like a little more tilt.  Not a lot, just enough to make it look like he''s fighting to stay in the chair, perhaps 5-15 more degrees.  Don''t go full 45, though, a diagonal would not do this shot justice.', '2008-03-06 12:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543275, 654444, 26001, '<td valign="top">very edgy portrait of a beautiful model. clothes suit the pose and attitude of the model this portrait conveys. i think eye-contact would have helped a lot. btw what the heck is she sitting in? some sort of weird public art(sculpture)?</td>', 'very edgy portrait of a beautiful model. clothes suit the pose and attitude of the model this portrait conveys. i think eye-contact would have helped a lot. btw what the heck is she sitting in? some sort of weird public art(sculpture)?', '2008-03-06 12:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543277, 654447, 26001, '<td valign="top">very very well visualized and equally good executed. nice use of wide-angle.</td>', 'very very well visualized and equally good executed. nice use of wide-angle.', '2008-03-06 12:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543286, 654683, 89341, '<td valign="top">An interesting angle but IMHO not really an interesting enough subject</td>', 'An interesting angle but IMHO not really an interesting enough subject', '2008-03-06 12:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543288, 654625, 89341, '<td valign="top">Personally I find the tilt of the photograph a little off putting rather than enhancing it, sorry. Maybe if the photo had been taken at the bottom looking up would have made it more interesting?</td>', 'Personally I find the tilt of the photograph a little off putting rather than enhancing it, sorry. Maybe if the photo had been taken at the bottom looking up would have made it more interesting?', '2008-03-06 12:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543290, 653327, 26001, '<td valign="top">i like the building and the way you controlled highlights in the whites in the bright-sunny lighting conditions.</td>', 'i like the building and the way you controlled highlights in the whites in the bright-sunny lighting conditions.', '2008-03-06 12:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543293, 652331, 89341, '<td valign="top">The colour of the sky is good, I think the exposure may have been a little too long perhaps? I think it''s a cropped a little too much and needs more of the doors in the photo ... maybe taking the photo looking up one of the towers?</td>', 'The colour of the sky is good, I think the exposure may have been a little too long perhaps? I think it''s a cropped a little too much and needs more of the doors in the photo ... maybe taking the photo looking up one of the towers?', '2008-03-06 12:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543294, 654427, 26001, '<td valign="top">i like this almost abstract landscape. nice exposure controlling bright snow.</td>', 'i like this almost abstract landscape. nice exposure controlling bright snow.', '2008-03-06 12:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543296, 654121, 89341, '<td valign="top">There''s too much going on in this picture for my liking, maybe a plain sheet behind the wheel and remove the helmet would clean it up a bit. Having the wheel spinning would have looked pretty good I reckon</td>', 'There''s too much going on in this picture for my liking, maybe a plain sheet behind the wheel and remove the helmet would clean it up a bit. Having the wheel spinning would have looked pretty good I reckon', '2008-03-06 12:52:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4543299, 654292, 89341, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really work for me sorry .... I find I tilt my head to look at the image rather than the angle the shot was taken at adding to the image</td>', 'Doesn''t really work for me sorry .... I find I tilt my head to look at the image rather than the angle the shot was taken at adding to the image', '2008-03-06 12:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543303, 653331, 89341, '<td valign="top">The colours in this are very good ... I think the image could be a little larger, it can be 640px wide</td>', 'The colours in this are very good ... I think the image could be a little larger, it can be 640px wide', '2008-03-06 12:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543304, 653833, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp shot, works well for me</td>', 'Nice sharp shot, works well for me', '2008-03-06 13:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543313, 653525, 26001, '<td valign="top">if i were to try this, i would have poured beer in the other side of the glass (touching the glass side, close to the top of the glass edge). that would have forced viewers to have a closer look to understand the pic in this rotation. nice idea and lighting nonetheless.</td>', 'if i were to try this, i would have poured beer in the other side of the glass (touching the glass side, close to the top of the glass edge). that would have forced viewers to have a closer look to understand the pic in this rotation. nice idea and lighting nonetheless.', '2008-03-06 13:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543320, 653468, 26001, '<td valign="top">very nice example of sport photography. subject is just a bit softer than the water in front of him. still a nice shot in difficult situation.</td>', 'very nice example of sport photography. subject is just a bit softer than the water in front of him. still a nice shot in difficult situation.', '2008-03-06 13:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543322, 653898, 26001, '<td valign="top">now this is cool. like the vibrant yellow and red. nice use of wide-angle too.</td>', 'now this is cool. like the vibrant yellow and red. nice use of wide-angle too.', '2008-03-06 13:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543327, 654296, 26001, '<td valign="top">like the bw conversion, dof, and documentary feel of this shot.</td>', 'like the bw conversion, dof, and documentary feel of this shot.', '2008-03-06 13:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543334, 654372, 26001, '<td valign="top">very nice composition and excellent exposure covering such a wide range of lighting. did you use any HDR technique by any chance?</td>', 'very nice composition and excellent exposure covering such a wide range of lighting. did you use any HDR technique by any chance?', '2008-03-06 13:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543347, 654528, 26001, '<td valign="top">excellent minimalistic architectural shot with beautiful and smooth gray tones.</td>', 'excellent minimalistic architectural shot with beautiful and smooth gray tones.', '2008-03-06 13:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543365, 654325, 81382, '<td valign="top">At last, a subject that is tilted - not just the camera/crop angle. Nice and sharp, simple concept, only a bit of motion blur to enhance your title could make this better</td>', 'At last, a subject that is tilted - not just the camera/crop angle. Nice and sharp, simple concept, only a bit of motion blur to enhance your title could make this better', '2008-03-06 13:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543372, 653851, 81382, '<td valign="top">Very interesting idea, shame the highlights are burnt out a little. Waiting for the magic end of day sun to see what a difference that would have made would have been interesting</td>', 'Very interesting idea, shame the highlights are burnt out a little. Waiting for the magic end of day sun to see what a difference that would have made would have been interesting', '2008-03-06 13:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543376, 654602, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely complementary colours in the orange and blue. Just lacking sharpness - seems a little noisy as if overly compressed which is a shame</td>', 'Lovely complementary colours in the orange and blue. Just lacking sharpness - seems a little noisy as if overly compressed which is a shame', '2008-03-06 13:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543381, 654770, 81382, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, amazing sharpness and strong colouring. Nice to see a subject that is tilted rather than just the camera/crop. Easily reproducable though and so doesn''t get top marks from me</td>', 'Nicely done, amazing sharpness and strong colouring. Nice to see a subject that is tilted rather than just the camera/crop. Easily reproducable though and so doesn''t get top marks from me', '2008-03-06 13:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543384, 653784, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great DOF, if only the drivers in the background weren''t directly behind the leading one, perhaps positoned more to the right so A) they can be seen, B) fill the gap and balance the composition</td>', 'Great DOF, if only the drivers in the background weren''t directly behind the leading one, perhaps positoned more to the right so A) they can be seen, B) fill the gap and balance the composition', '2008-03-06 13:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543399, 654372, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great sky - but strongly smells of HDR and didn''t think this was allowed in basic editing.</td>', 'Great sky - but strongly smells of HDR and didn''t think this was allowed in basic editing.', '2008-03-06 13:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543410, 653525, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting, the beer''s angle in the glass is the opposite of what it seems it should be, and the downward flow is also not what it seems. Very well done.</td>', 'Interesting, the beer''s angle in the glass is the opposite of what it seems it should be, and the downward flow is also not what it seems. Very well done.', '2008-03-06 13:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543414, 654325, 86447, '<td valign="top">I think the ''liquid'' in the glass needs to be level to the horizon for this optical illusion to work at its best.   Great lighting.</td>', 'I think the ''liquid'' in the glass needs to be level to the horizon for this optical illusion to work at its best.   Great lighting.', '2008-03-06 13:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543430, 653284, 3765, '<td valign="top">I find that you have an enormous potential here concerning the subject-matter. Only the "tilt" is too extreme and I find the dark rim a bit distracting.</td>', 'I find that you have an enormous potential here concerning the subject-matter. Only the "tilt" is too extreme and I find the dark rim a bit distracting.', '2008-03-06 13:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543431, 654756, 3765, '<td valign="top">Yes!! Well composed, nice sharpness and well exposed. 8</td>', 'Yes!! Well composed, nice sharpness and well exposed. 8', '2008-03-06 14:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543441, 654718, 90658, '<td valign="top">This one would have done really well in the B&amp;W in Color challenge.</td>', 'This one would have done really well in the B&W in Color challenge.', '2008-03-06 14:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543476, 653422, 90658, '<td valign="top">More of a tilt to the left would really communicate the tease of the balls rolling away.</td>', 'More of a tilt to the left would really communicate the tease of the balls rolling away.', '2008-03-06 14:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543483, 654436, 26001, '<td valign="top">nice perspective and angle. wish i could see some more details in the foreground shadows though. fill-in flash could have helped here.</td>', 'nice perspective and angle. wish i could see some more details in the foreground shadows though. fill-in flash could have helped here.', '2008-03-06 14:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543490, 654474, 26001, '<td valign="top">even though this has been done many times before the difficulty and coolness of this kind of shots always make me appreciate the attempt, especially a nice one like this. good work.</td>', 'even though this has been done many times before the difficulty and coolness of this kind of shots always make me appreciate the attempt, especially a nice one like this. good work.', '2008-03-06 14:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543493, 652170, 26001, '<td valign="top">if you had waited for a week, this would have been PERFECT for one of the current challenges, "blurry mess". dont see camera tilt but nice mood btw.</td>', 'if you had waited for a week, this would have been PERFECT for one of the current challenges, "blurry mess". dont see camera tilt but nice mood btw.', '2008-03-06 14:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543499, 654509, 26001, '<td valign="top">excellent job catching the ball in the frame. dont you wish if it was clicked like 1/50 seconds earlier (ball hitting the stumps) :) nice job nonetheless. havent been to any cricket match in a loooooong time. it was good to see India beat Australia recently in the series though. yay!!!</td>', 'excellent job catching the ball in the frame. dont you wish if it was clicked like 1/50 seconds earlier (ball hitting the stumps) :) nice job nonetheless. havent been to any cricket match in a loooooong time. it was good to see India beat Australia recently in the series though. yay!!!', '2008-03-06 14:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543505, 654429, 90658, '<td valign="top">Perhaps tilted to the right to "elongate" the shadows.  It tricks the eye to continue the dark out of the shot.</td>', 'Perhaps tilted to the right to "elongate" the shadows.  It tricks the eye to continue the dark out of the shot.', '2008-03-06 14:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543506, 654447, 90658, '<td valign="top">Why not the down escaltor?</td>', 'Why not the down escaltor?', '2008-03-06 14:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543674, 653331, 88700, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this image.  Great shot.</td>', 'I love the colors in this image.  Great shot.', '2008-03-06 15:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543784, 654436, 73661, '<td valign="top">There are tons of images in this challenge that are tilted nonsensically and I am already dizzy looking at them.  <br/> <br/>This is probably, by far, one of the best images that is tilted not just because the challenge says so. And you accomplished that by giving a foreground subject to focus on. Great job. 10.</td>', 'There are tons of images in this challenge that are tilted nonsensically and I am already dizzy looking at them.   This is probably, by far, one of the best images that is tilted not just because the challenge says so. And you accomplished that by giving a foreground subject to focus on. Great job. 10.', '2008-03-06 16:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543810, 653734, 15291, '<td valign="top">Outrageous, hope the landing was soft. :)</td>', 'Outrageous, hope the landing was soft. :)', '2008-03-06 17:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543813, 654718, 15291, '<td valign="top">Well done, the composition &amp; tonality are excellent.</td>', 'Well done, the composition & tonality are excellent.', '2008-03-06 17:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543814, 654292, 15291, '<td valign="top">Well done, just a bit to much tilt for me.</td>', 'Well done, just a bit to much tilt for me.', '2008-03-06 17:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543815, 654513, 15291, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.</td>', 'Very nice image.', '2008-03-06 17:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543817, 653762, 15291, '<td valign="top">Simply awesome !</td>', 'Simply awesome !', '2008-03-06 17:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543822, 653374, 15291, '<td valign="top">Awesome image, the pink &amp; green clash making for a bit of a distraction.</td>', 'Awesome image, the pink & green clash making for a bit of a distraction.', '2008-03-06 17:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543834, 654644, 12733, '<td valign="top">One of the best interpretations of the challenge; the angle really does make the picture. Nice texture on the dog''s fur, and a great wistful look on his face.</td>', 'One of the best interpretations of the challenge; the angle really does make the picture. Nice texture on the dog''s fur, and a great wistful look on his face.', '2008-03-06 17:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543838, 654510, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great semi-abstract. I like the textures and shapes.</td>', 'Great semi-abstract. I like the textures and shapes.', '2008-03-06 17:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543843, 654426, 12733, '<td valign="top">Having the guy hold onto the rail is a great touch. He really looks like he''s trying to stop himself from sliding.</td>', 'Having the guy hold onto the rail is a great touch. He really looks like he''s trying to stop himself from sliding.', '2008-03-06 17:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543844, 654754, 19572, '<td valign="top">To the point statement for sure!  I love the texture around the chair.</td>', 'To the point statement for sure!  I love the texture around the chair.', '2008-03-06 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543850, 654636, 12733, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and textures.</td>', 'Love the colors and textures.', '2008-03-06 17:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543854, 653486, 12733, '<td valign="top">Reminiscent of a Max Escher drawing - disorienting and interesting. Makes you look to try to work it out.</td>', 'Reminiscent of a Max Escher drawing - disorienting and interesting. Makes you look to try to work it out.', '2008-03-06 17:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543861, 653851, 12733, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit like an acid vision. I think it would be more in keeping with the challenge if the horizon weren''t so obviously straight, but a great shot.</td>', 'Looks a bit like an acid vision. I think it would be more in keeping with the challenge if the horizon weren''t so obviously straight, but a great shot.', '2008-03-06 17:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543874, 654650, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very funny. Nicely exposed and lighted, too.</td>', 'Very funny. Nicely exposed and lighted, too.', '2008-03-06 17:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543878, 654756, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute.</td>', 'Very cute.', '2008-03-06 17:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543879, 652380, 19572, '<td valign="top">Sky is a little bright, distracts form the subject.  But the horse does look friendly :)</td>', 'Sky is a little bright, distracts form the subject.  But the horse does look friendly :)', '2008-03-06 17:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543892, 653490, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and composition, but needs more depth of focus.</td>', 'Nice idea and composition, but needs more depth of focus.', '2008-03-06 17:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543896, 654436, 19572, '<td valign="top">I like the distorted perspective, well done.</td>', 'I like the distorted perspective, well done.', '2008-03-06 17:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543898, 654435, 19572, '<td valign="top">This made me smile.</td>', 'This made me smile.', '2008-03-06 18:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543924, 652811, 26001, '<td valign="top">in this kind of situations, i always prefer to have models with clothes that can show some details (lighter colors) in the photograph. i like the composition, hint of colors, pose of the model, and tilt very much.</td>', 'in this kind of situations, i always prefer to have models with clothes that can show some details (lighter colors) in the photograph. i like the composition, hint of colors, pose of the model, and tilt very much.', '2008-03-06 18:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544028, 654778, 87252, '<td valign="top">This is a bit of a DNMC, Would have been a really cool shot if you;d actually tilted the camera slightly when you took it!!</td>', 'This is a bit of a DNMC, Would have been a really cool shot if you;d actually tilted the camera slightly when you took it!!', '2008-03-06 19:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544035, 653902, 87252, '<td valign="top">Cool idea and awesome paint job but I think the light is too harsh, She needs a back light and one set up at 45degrees and above her. Also she doesn''t look particularly comfortable, possibly adjust the position a bit... I really like it though.</td>', 'Cool idea and awesome paint job but I think the light is too harsh, She needs a back light and one set up at 45degrees and above her. Also she doesn''t look particularly comfortable, possibly adjust the position a bit... I really like it though.', '2008-03-06 19:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544255, 654662, 31214, '<td valign="top">I''ve only been through a few entries, but I have to tell you, this one will be hard to beat.  The only way I could figure it out was to orient with the clouds.  Great job!</td>', 'I''ve only been through a few entries, but I have to tell you, this one will be hard to beat.  The only way I could figure it out was to orient with the clouds.  Great job!', '2008-03-06 21:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544306, 653920, 31214, '<td valign="top">Very cool alignment, especially at the top.  Well done!</td>', 'Very cool alignment, especially at the top.  Well done!', '2008-03-06 21:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544352, 653833, 20889, '<td valign="top">For me the over all shot is good. Nice angle, the main subject is on a third.<br/>Maybe some shallower depth of field to icilate the main subject.</td>', 'For me the over all shot is good. Nice angle, the main subject is on a third.Maybe some shallower depth of field to icilate the main subject.', '2008-03-06 22:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544356, 654450, 20889, '<td valign="top">The foreground is a bit distracting, maybe just shoot pass these.</td>', 'The foreground is a bit distracting, maybe just shoot pass these.', '2008-03-06 22:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544362, 653447, 20889, '<td valign="top">Think you could have titled more.</td>', 'Think you could have titled more.', '2008-03-06 22:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544372, 654356, 20889, '<td valign="top">A bit noisy and I know you may not have had a second chance to shoot them again :-p</td>', 'A bit noisy and I know you may not have had a second chance to shoot them again :-p', '2008-03-06 22:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544373, 653486, 20889, '<td valign="top">To bad its blowed out, this would have made a nice abstract.</td>', 'To bad its blowed out, this would have made a nice abstract.', '2008-03-06 22:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544382, 652890, 20889, '<td valign="top">It is a small amout on the flat side. Black just don''t seem black, maybe a bit of contrast.</td>', 'It is a small amout on the flat side. Black just don''t seem black, maybe a bit of contrast.', '2008-03-06 22:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
