(4546468, 653840, 53316, '<td valign="top">Awesome title - definitely fits the image for me.</td>', 'Awesome title - definitely fits the image for me.', '2008-03-07 18:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546469, 654650, 39675, '<td valign="top">Ok. So I''m commenting again.  I can''t believe it didn''t stay the first time.  I really enjoyed having you in class.  You made very consistent progress throughout the term.  The other students really noticed your talent and trusted you to help them.  It is awesome that you are getting a high score with this photo.  Great Job!</td>', 'Ok. So I''m commenting again.  I can''t believe it didn''t stay the first time.  I really enjoyed having you in class.  You made very consistent progress throughout the term.  The other students really noticed your talent and trusted you to help them.  It is awesome that you are getting a high score with this photo.  Great Job!', '2008-03-07 18:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546523, 654638, 88700, '<td valign="top">Hanaknaks.  This photo is fabulous.  You''re photos were true to yourself... and I admire that.</td>', 'Hanaknaks.  This photo is fabulous.  You''re photos were true to yourself... and I admire that.', '2008-03-07 19:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546538, 654039, 88700, '<td valign="top">My first thought is that I''ve never seen such photography skills in my entire life.  My second thought was that I have never seen a model with modeling skill like that.  I''ll go with my second thought.  I don''t know what I was thinking with that first thought.<br/> <br/>The photo is slightly below average from a technical standpoint.  I would have the model sit on the side and throw the camera into the trap door, so the photographer doesn''t participate in any more challenges. 10!</td>', 'My first thought is that I''ve never seen such photography skills in my entire life.  My second thought was that I have never seen a model with modeling skill like that.  I''ll go with my second thought.  I don''t know what I was thinking with that first thought. The photo is slightly below average from a technical standpoint.  I would have the model sit on the side and throw the camera into the trap door, so the photographer doesn''t participate in any more challenges. 10!', '2008-03-07 19:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546545, 654642, 88700, '<td valign="top">I like the concept.  You take photos like you count pennies if you get my drift.  10.  In case there is any confusion that''s a good thing.</td>', 'I like the concept.  You take photos like you count pennies if you get my drift.  10.  In case there is any confusion that''s a good thing.', '2008-03-07 19:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546556, 654444, 3765, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely my favourite during this challenge. The composition is so appealing that my eyes follow a circular motion to end up with the model''s eyes above the glasses. The use of black and white enhances this tremendously. Technically the shot is also superb. Nice use of dof, good detail and perfectly cropped. Well done! Changing the nine to ten.</td>', 'This is absolutely my favourite during this challenge. The composition is so appealing that my eyes follow a circular motion to end up with the model''s eyes above the glasses. The use of black and white enhances this tremendously. Technically the shot is also superb. Nice use of dof, good detail and perfectly cropped. Well done! Changing the nine to ten.', '2008-03-07 19:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546612, 654648, 88700, '<td valign="top">I''m going to have to say this photo has left me speechless.  Either 1 or 10.</td>', 'I''m going to have to say this photo has left me speechless.  Either 1 or 10.', '2008-03-07 20:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546613, 653979, 88700, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I love the leading lines in this image.</td>', 'Great shot!  I love the leading lines in this image.', '2008-03-07 20:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
