(4547319, 654662, 39675, '<td valign="top">This was the best time.  That first day I got a 7 hour conversation and a great tan.  The second day you got a great photo.  I hope it ribbons.  BTW I''m very proud of how CREATIVE you have been over the last couple of months.  It''s been memorable.</td>', 'This was the best time.  That first day I got a 7 hour conversation and a great tan.  The second day you got a great photo.  I hope it ribbons.  BTW I''m very proud of how CREATIVE you have been over the last couple of months.  It''s been memorable.', '2008-03-08 02:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4547354, 654404, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wowsers!!! What an awesome shot! Wonderful concept all together. Just a totally sweet point of view. Don''t think I''ve ever seen it before. The lighting, and dof work really well here. This is very ''abstracty'', yet after viewing for a second, you realize what it it, then the whole point kind of hits you, if you know what I mean. Good title too. This is just delightful, it stopped me in my tracks, and caught my interest upon opening, then as you view it, like I said, it all just creeps up and hits you. Bam! Great shot, love it!</td>', 'Wowsers!!! What an awesome shot! Wonderful concept all together. Just a totally sweet point of view. Don''t think I''ve ever seen it before. The lighting, and dof work really well here. This is very ''abstracty'', yet after viewing for a second, you realize what it it, then the whole point kind of hits you, if you know what I mean. Good title too. This is just delightful, it stopped me in my tracks, and caught my interest upon opening, then as you view it, like I said, it all just creeps up and hits you. Bam! Great shot, love it!', '2008-03-08 02:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
