(4547440, 652947, 71121, '<td valign="top">Wow, me likes! Outside the bounds of this challenge''s basic rules I would brighten up the top part a bit. Or - move down the horizon and add even more darkness in the top for drama.</td>', 'Wow, me likes! Outside the bounds of this challenge''s basic rules I would brighten up the top part a bit. Or - move down the horizon and add even more darkness in the top for drama.', '2008-03-08 03:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
