(4547491, 653468, 71131, '<td valign="top">Tack sharp and great sharpness. Love the water drops. Certainly one of the top 10. It''s just a shame his face wasn''t looking towards the camera. Still great though.</td>', 'Tack sharp and great sharpness. Love the water drops. Certainly one of the top 10. It''s just a shame his face wasn''t looking towards the camera. Still great though.', '2008-03-08 04:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
