(4547519, 653596, 71131, '<td valign="top">One of my favourite shots in this comp. Great pose with the bird. Perfect DOF keeps some of that interesting branch in focus aswell. Great clarity in the colours. You have done really well here.</td>', 'One of my favourite shots in this comp. Great pose with the bird. Perfect DOF keeps some of that interesting branch in focus aswell. Great clarity in the colours. You have done really well here.', '2008-03-08 04:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
