(4547532, 654436, 71131, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Superb execution.</td>', 'Great idea. Superb execution.', '2008-03-08 04:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4547576, 652970, 37252, '<td valign="top">The image itself is a bit dark. If there were more reflections from the water it would help some, but still lacks a ''center of attention'' or focal point. I''m not sure I would have chosen to crop this vertically - but hard to say without seeing what you had to start with.<br/>As for the challenge theme, I really don''t see this as an image that was shot at an angle that ''made'' the image which in my mind is what the idea was.<br/>On a positive note, you did get nice sharp detail and the DOF is good.</td>', 'The image itself is a bit dark. If there were more reflections from the water it would help some, but still lacks a ''center of attention'' or focal point. I''m not sure I would have chosen to crop this vertically - but hard to say without seeing what you had to start with.As for the challenge theme, I really don''t see this as an image that was shot at an angle that ''made'' the image which in my mind is what the idea was.On a positive note, you did get nice sharp detail and the DOF is good.', '2008-03-08 06:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4547579, 654444, 90394, '<td valign="top">Nice. And a great caption, too. Well composed and fun.</td>', 'Nice. And a great caption, too. Well composed and fun.', '2008-03-08 06:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4547580, 652899, 37252, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the colors here at all. I really wish the image was in focus too. It''s hard to see what you were trying to convey. Perhaps after the challenge I''ll be able to find out by reading your details.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the colors here at all. I really wish the image was in focus too. It''s hard to see what you were trying to convey. Perhaps after the challenge I''ll be able to find out by reading your details.', '2008-03-08 06:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
