(4547993, 654516, 20889, '<td valign="top">Even though it may not be eye candy for the dpc voters. You really have some nice colors, you could have pulled on the yellows a bit. That would have made a nice complementary colors. Also I might suggest cropping some off the right side and the bottom.</td>', 'Even though it may not be eye candy for the dpc voters. You really have some nice colors, you could have pulled on the yellows a bit. That would have made a nice complementary colors. Also I might suggest cropping some off the right side and the bottom.', '2008-03-08 10:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
