(4548214, 653244, 91168, '<td valign="top">I love this. This is cute! I also admire the way you kind of highlighted the white rocks. :O Is the fishie upside down? My fish always did that. And then he died. :(  Great photo. Well done.</td>', 'I love this. This is cute! I also admire the way you kind of highlighted the white rocks. :O Is the fishie upside down? My fish always did that. And then he died. :(  Great photo. Well done.', '2008-03-08 12:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4548219, 654647, 91168, '<td valign="top"><b>I''m not too interested in this photo. The fine wires are slightly blurred but thats not too much of a problem.</b></td>', 'I''m not too interested in this photo. The fine wires are slightly blurred but thats not too much of a problem.', '2008-03-08 12:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
