(4548228, 654380, 91168, '<td valign="top"><b>I really LOVE this photograph. It''s not too clear and the soft slightly blurry look is beautiful. :D I''m not sure what it actually is, I think its a cactus.. The only thing is, I''m not sure how it ties in with ''tilted'' O.o Its a really good photo anyways!</b></td>', 'I really LOVE this photograph. It''s not too clear and the soft slightly blurry look is beautiful. :D I''m not sure what it actually is, I think its a cactus.. The only thing is, I''m not sure how it ties in with ''tilted'' O.o Its a really good photo anyways!', '2008-03-08 12:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4548232, 654491, 91168, '<td valign="top"><b>It''s quite good. Not really what I look for in a photo but it''s might appeal to others than me. I''ll give it a reasonable score because the lighting is quite nice &amp; I like stars. :)</b></td>', 'It''s quite good. Not really what I look for in a photo but it''s might appeal to others than me. I''ll give it a reasonable score because the lighting is quite nice & I like stars. :)', '2008-03-08 12:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4548236, 653770, 91168, '<td valign="top"><b>Good. I love the bright colours in this photo. The blurriness at the bottom isnt great in my opinion. :]</b></td>', 'Good. I love the bright colours in this photo. The blurriness at the bottom isnt great in my opinion. :]', '2008-03-08 12:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
