(4548959, 652947, 90394, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, and frankly don''t care if it whole-heartedly meets challenge criteria, but it did affect my scoring, since one assumes you "turn" things upside down, rather than tilt them upside down. But why didn''t you tilt this more??? I would like to see this alittle sharper too, but still a great pic.</td>', 'I love this shot, and frankly don''t care if it whole-heartedly meets challenge criteria, but it did affect my scoring, since one assumes you "turn" things upside down, rather than tilt them upside down. But why didn''t you tilt this more??? I would like to see this alittle sharper too, but still a great pic.', '2008-03-08 19:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
