(4548977, 654541, 90394, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colors, and composition. A bit sharper would be nice here, and saturation seems about right, as well as spot-on contrast. I''m betting you would have liked to chop that tree down, on the left, huh?</td>', 'Fantastic colors, and composition. A bit sharper would be nice here, and saturation seems about right, as well as spot-on contrast. I''m betting you would have liked to chop that tree down, on the left, huh?', '2008-03-08 19:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
