(4549321, 652327, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic! Terrific idea and well executed.</td>', 'This is fantastic! Terrific idea and well executed.', '2008-03-08 23:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549324, 654779, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''m intrigued by this. The harsh shadows, the subjects only half visible, where they''re going to (or coming from). The angle, of course, makes this work. An eight for you.</td>', 'I''m intrigued by this. The harsh shadows, the subjects only half visible, where they''re going to (or coming from). The angle, of course, makes this work. An eight for you.', '2008-03-08 23:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549325, 654429, 76335, '<td valign="top">Absolutely awesome in every way. What more to say? A nine for you.</td>', 'Absolutely awesome in every way. What more to say? A nine for you.', '2008-03-08 23:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549341, 652779, 90113, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but DNMC for me.</td>', 'Nice capture, but DNMC for me.', '2008-03-08 23:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549411, 653490, 20889, '<td valign="top">May I suggest-black and white, colors to far off and not enough to mess with.</td>', 'May I suggest-black and white, colors to far off and not enough to mess with.', '2008-03-08 23:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549437, 653331, 20889, '<td valign="top">Since there a lot of good contrasting colors here, I think it would have made stunning black and white.</td>', 'Since there a lot of good contrasting colors here, I think it would have made stunning black and white.', '2008-03-09 00:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549495, 653468, 7743, '<td valign="top">45 degrees seems to be a common choice for tilting the image.  For this one, I think that''s a bit too much.  I feel the image would be much more dynamic if the bar were coming into the image from the top left corner.  It would feel less contrived and more deliberate.</td>', '45 degrees seems to be a common choice for tilting the image.  For this one, I think that''s a bit too much.  I feel the image would be much more dynamic if the bar were coming into the image from the top left corner.  It would feel less contrived and more deliberate.', '2008-03-09 01:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549617, 653679, 5364, '<td valign="top">I wonder if you would have been better filling the frame with the cactus, so it went from corner to corner? I like it though.</td>', 'I wonder if you would have been better filling the frame with the cactus, so it went from corner to corner? I like it though.', '2008-03-09 05:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549618, 654714, 5364, '<td valign="top">I wonder if this might be better in monochrome as the bright yellow flowers on the gorse wouldn''t be so prominent then.</td>', 'I wonder if this might be better in monochrome as the bright yellow flowers on the gorse wouldn''t be so prominent then.', '2008-03-09 06:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549625, 653606, 87252, '<td valign="top">Over processed, I think that you have taken the curves slightly too far in this shot, and that combined with your black and white conversion the shot is left looking slightly blown out and unnatural.<br/> <br/>-I just thought I''d expand slightly, I know how annoying it is when you get a two word comment.</td>', 'Over processed, I think that you have taken the curves slightly too far in this shot, and that combined with your black and white conversion the shot is left looking slightly blown out and unnatural. -I just thought I''d expand slightly, I know how annoying it is when you get a two word comment.', '2008-03-09 06:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549640, 652811, 90394, '<td valign="top">Excellently composed, and very natural looking model! Nice capture, great levels and use of the tilt liscense.</td>', 'Excellently composed, and very natural looking model! Nice capture, great levels and use of the tilt liscense.', '2008-03-09 07:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549641, 654736, 90394, '<td valign="top">Could be a bit sharper, and nature scenes are a slightly generic way to find "tilt", but a good pic nonetheless. More contrast, and brighter light source would have been beneficial.</td>', 'Could be a bit sharper, and nature scenes are a slightly generic way to find "tilt", but a good pic nonetheless. More contrast, and brighter light source would have been beneficial.', '2008-03-09 07:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549642, 654626, 32011, '<td valign="top">Ahhh... love the Tulla Fwy.  :)<br/> <br/>I like the stars formed by the lights... feel the black areas are a bit much though.</td>', 'Ahhh... love the Tulla Fwy.  :) I like the stars formed by the lights... feel the black areas are a bit much though.', '2008-03-09 07:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549643, 654379, 90394, '<td valign="top">A pretty generic church shot, probably pulled from your "architecture" folder, right? I''m not seeing creative use of the <i>tilt</i> license here, but it sure is purty!!</td>', 'A pretty generic church shot, probably pulled from your "architecture" folder, right? I''m not seeing creative use of the tilt license here, but it sure is purty!!', '2008-03-09 07:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549644, 654376, 32011, '<td valign="top">Nice image... I love the lack of a visible "horizontal" (or what would have originally been the horizontal), and that the viewer is forced to deduce where  it is from the reflection. I love images that make me think.</td>', 'Nice image... I love the lack of a visible "horizontal" (or what would have originally been the horizontal), and that the viewer is forced to deduce where  it is from the reflection. I love images that make me think.', '2008-03-09 07:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549645, 653298, 90394, '<td valign="top">Well composed, and kinda creative use of <i>tilt,</i> but some color on the back of the windmill would have given this some oomph. An otherwise fine capture.</td>', 'Well composed, and kinda creative use of tilt, but some color on the back of the windmill would have given this some oomph. An otherwise fine capture.', '2008-03-09 07:13:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4549646, 654474, 32011, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... advertisement quality.</td>', 'Nice shot... advertisement quality.', '2008-03-09 07:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549647, 654412, 90394, '<td valign="top">Hey!!! Another fruit dropping!!! lol. I''m not going to ding this in the voting, since it looks fine - but no points for creativity either. These always look like sample shots to me. Maybe drop a pear in next time, just for something different? Or better yet - a potato!!!! LOL! Great colors and light, good capture.</td>', 'Hey!!! Another fruit dropping!!! lol. I''m not going to ding this in the voting, since it looks fine - but no points for creativity either. These always look like sample shots to me. Maybe drop a pear in next time, just for something different? Or better yet - a potato!!!! LOL! Great colors and light, good capture.', '2008-03-09 07:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549648, 654644, 32011, '<td valign="top">How sad does this dog look.  Nice and clear shot.  Dark and light regions balance one another nicely.  Detail in the nose and snout is excellent.</td>', 'How sad does this dog look.  Nice and clear shot.  Dark and light regions balance one another nicely.  Detail in the nose and snout is excellent.', '2008-03-09 07:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549649, 654770, 90394, '<td valign="top">Simple, sharp and elegant. And also familiar looking. There''s not much to critique here, it''s a fine shot. But no points for creativity, nor originality. I''ll say this: these would look great on a fine resteraunt''s wall.</td>', 'Simple, sharp and elegant. And also familiar looking. There''s not much to critique here, it''s a fine shot. But no points for creativity, nor originality. I''ll say this: these would look great on a fine resteraunt''s wall.', '2008-03-09 07:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549651, 654474, 90394, '<td valign="top">A beautiful motion auto-shot, acceptable use of Tilt, and fine colors - but with a few distractions, like the light-up sign in the background.</td>', 'A beautiful motion auto-shot, acceptable use of Tilt, and fine colors - but with a few distractions, like the light-up sign in the background.', '2008-03-09 07:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549653, 654775, 90394, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit, nice Tilt, sharpness and spatiality - the "pole" is a bit of a distraction, until you see how congruent it is with the rest of the angles captured here - very nice!!!</td>', 'Beautifully lit, nice Tilt, sharpness and spatiality - the "pole" is a bit of a distraction, until you see how congruent it is with the rest of the angles captured here - very nice!!!', '2008-03-09 07:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549882, 654528, 76335, '<td valign="top">Conceptually, I think this is great. Excellent (tilted) angle and crop. Black-and-white was a good choice. I think it may have benefited from a little more depth or contrast (and/or sharpeness maybe) to bring out some of the subtle textures in the concrete and give it some perspective. Still, an eight for you.</td>', 'Conceptually, I think this is great. Excellent (tilted) angle and crop. Black-and-white was a good choice. I think it may have benefited from a little more depth or contrast (and/or sharpeness maybe) to bring out some of the subtle textures in the concrete and give it some perspective. Still, an eight for you.', '2008-03-09 11:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549883, 654404, 76335, '<td valign="top">I had to do a double take on this one with my BACK button. The tones, the DOF, and the overall idea and composition are excellent. An eight for you.</td>', 'I had to do a double take on this one with my BACK button. The tones, the DOF, and the overall idea and composition are excellent. An eight for you.', '2008-03-09 11:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549886, 652170, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very well done. I might have presented it at more of an angle, but overall it''s great. A seven for you.</td>', 'Very well done. I might have presented it at more of an angle, but overall it''s great. A seven for you.', '2008-03-09 11:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549981, 654527, 87898, '<td valign="top">its a bit too much gray which makes it a little bit flat. if you had more contrast in it i think it would have turned out better.</td>', 'its a bit too much gray which makes it a little bit flat. if you had more contrast in it i think it would have turned out better.', '2008-03-09 12:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549984, 653551, 87898, '<td valign="top">the color of the sky is beautiful!</td>', 'the color of the sky is beautiful!', '2008-03-09 12:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549988, 654436, 89494, '<td valign="top">that''s the winner.<br/> <br/>I anticipated correctly. You won! Congratulations<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-04-23 11:32:57.</i></td>', 'that''s the winner. I anticipated correctly. You won! Congratulations', '2008-03-09 13:02:46.000000', '2008-04-23 12:32:57.000000', 1),
(4550121, 654666, 89065, '<td valign="top">funny how the slope looks flat... ;)</td>', 'funny how the slope looks flat... ;)', '2008-03-09 14:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550131, 654770, 90495, '<td valign="top">Ah yes, well done. Surprised to see this for the first time. I like the bg lighting. Good work.</td>', 'Ah yes, well done. Surprised to see this for the first time. I like the bg lighting. Good work.', '2008-03-09 14:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550140, 654600, 90495, '<td valign="top">This is one of the rare tilted shots that actually work, in fact the first. I still would like the untilted version i''m sure.</td>', 'This is one of the rare tilted shots that actually work, in fact the first. I still would like the untilted version i''m sure.', '2008-03-09 14:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550145, 652538, 90495, '<td valign="top">Good lines and movement. A bit small for my taste.</td>', 'Good lines and movement. A bit small for my taste.', '2008-03-09 14:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550154, 654676, 90495, '<td valign="top">Because the highlight is prominent, we are immediately led to it at first glance. But since it is oof it kind of gives the whole pic a blurry feel. Suggestion; try not centering it next time, I would have put it slightly to the  right leaving the open space for the incoming light direction.</td>', 'Because the highlight is prominent, we are immediately led to it at first glance. But since it is oof it kind of gives the whole pic a blurry feel. Suggestion; try not centering it next time, I would have put it slightly to the  right leaving the open space for the incoming light direction.', '2008-03-09 14:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550162, 654509, 90495, '<td valign="top">Good shot and it fits the game plan for this challenge. We see movement not only from the player''s actions but from the angle the ground is to the camera.</td>', 'Good shot and it fits the game plan for this challenge. We see movement not only from the player''s actions but from the angle the ground is to the camera.', '2008-03-09 14:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550164, 654474, 90495, '<td valign="top">Good work on this. I like the shot you captured. Movement is great.</td>', 'Good work on this. I like the shot you captured. Movement is great.', '2008-03-09 14:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550169, 652899, 90495, '<td valign="top">I would use this pic as a warning sign on some construction site or another hazardous area. I like it.</td>', 'I would use this pic as a warning sign on some construction site or another hazardous area. I like it.', '2008-03-09 14:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550245, 653734, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great capture that is perfectly composed for the challenge.</td>', 'Great capture that is perfectly composed for the challenge.', '2008-03-09 15:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550265, 654527, 49489, '<td valign="top">I like this picture but the pole seems to flat.</td>', 'I like this picture but the pole seems to flat.', '2008-03-09 15:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550267, 654474, 89426, '<td valign="top">I like this Photograph. The movement of the cars and lines make it look like an advertisment. Nice job.</td>', 'I like this Photograph. The movement of the cars and lines make it look like an advertisment. Nice job.', '2008-03-09 15:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550269, 654651, 89426, '<td valign="top">I think the background is kind of plain, but it make the eagle pop out.</td>', 'I think the background is kind of plain, but it make the eagle pop out.', '2008-03-09 15:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550272, 654113, 49489, '<td valign="top">intriguing</td>', 'intriguing', '2008-03-09 15:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550275, 654763, 89426, '<td valign="top">This is a good image. It looks like the picture is more complex, than just tilting your camera. I really like the 3 different focus points, and overall is a beautiful picture.</td>', 'This is a good image. It looks like the picture is more complex, than just tilting your camera. I really like the 3 different focus points, and overall is a beautiful picture.', '2008-03-09 15:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550276, 654427, 49489, '<td valign="top">winter yuck....beautiful picture!!!</td>', 'winter yuck....beautiful picture!!!', '2008-03-09 15:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550277, 654316, 89426, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this image is tilted, but it is very vibrant and there is a lot of good movement.</td>', 'I''m not sure how this image is tilted, but it is very vibrant and there is a lot of good movement.', '2008-03-09 15:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550279, 654489, 49489, '<td valign="top">If you would have changed this to b&amp;w WOW!  beautiful</td>', 'If you would have changed this to b&w WOW!  beautiful', '2008-03-09 15:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550283, 652134, 89426, '<td valign="top">I love this photograph. It is so simple, but complex at the same time. A great contrast and idea. I really like the movement of the birds that you captured, but it not being the focus point</td>', 'I love this photograph. It is so simple, but complex at the same time. A great contrast and idea. I really like the movement of the birds that you captured, but it not being the focus point', '2008-03-09 16:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550285, 654725, 89426, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors that you captured in this image. There is so much value.</td>', 'I really like the colors that you captured in this image. There is so much value.', '2008-03-09 16:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550290, 653447, 89426, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure this fits tilted, but it would fit reflections very well. This is a very nice picture though.</td>', 'I''m not sure this fits tilted, but it would fit reflections very well. This is a very nice picture though.', '2008-03-09 16:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550299, 654234, 89426, '<td valign="top">I like this image. This was a good subject for the shoot. The rythm that you capture is good.</td>', 'I like this image. This was a good subject for the shoot. The rythm that you capture is good.', '2008-03-09 16:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550307, 653374, 89426, '<td valign="top">This is a good image. The water droplits are placed well, and of course the detail on the fly is great. I really like the movement and rhythm in the lines of the flower.</td>', 'This is a good image. The water droplits are placed well, and of course the detail on the fly is great. I really like the movement and rhythm in the lines of the flower.', '2008-03-09 16:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550374, 653919, 89546, '<td valign="top">This picture doesn''t really fit the theme. The lighting is also poorly done.</td>', 'This picture doesn''t really fit the theme. The lighting is also poorly done.', '2008-03-09 16:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550381, 654631, 89546, '<td valign="top">The background doesnt distract you from the suject which is good. Plus, the shadow of the subject makes the shot more interseting.</td>', 'The background doesnt distract you from the suject which is good. Plus, the shadow of the subject makes the shot more interseting.', '2008-03-09 16:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550383, 654653, 89546, '<td valign="top">The water on the bridge with the reflection of the trees in it makes the shot very intersting, as does the reflections in the water. Nicely done.</td>', 'The water on the bridge with the reflection of the trees in it makes the shot very intersting, as does the reflections in the water. Nicely done.', '2008-03-09 16:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550386, 654499, 89546, '<td valign="top">This shot doesn''t meet the objective, as the shot should be tilted, not straight on.</td>', 'This shot doesn''t meet the objective, as the shot should be tilted, not straight on.', '2008-03-09 17:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550387, 654754, 89546, '<td valign="top">This photo doesn''t meet the objective of the shoot, the picture is taking looking straight down.</td>', 'This photo doesn''t meet the objective of the shoot, the picture is taking looking straight down.', '2008-03-09 17:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550393, 652134, 89546, '<td valign="top">Making this photo black and white was a good choice as it makes it more interesting. The repition of the fishing poles, the shadows, and the bird are all nice touches to the shot.</td>', 'Making this photo black and white was a good choice as it makes it more interesting. The repition of the fishing poles, the shadows, and the bird are all nice touches to the shot.', '2008-03-09 17:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550394, 654676, 89546, '<td valign="top">The background is very distracting as it is blurry. Using a creative camera angle would have made the shot more interesting as well.</td>', 'The background is very distracting as it is blurry. Using a creative camera angle would have made the shot more interesting as well.', '2008-03-09 17:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550398, 654642, 89546, '<td valign="top">The lighting on her face is a bit dark on her face, and a little too bright everywhere around her. It appears you photoshopped her into the background.</td>', 'The lighting on her face is a bit dark on her face, and a little too bright everywhere around her. It appears you photoshopped her into the background.', '2008-03-09 17:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550399, 653784, 89546, '<td valign="top">The subject stands out as the background is blurry and the person is sharply in focus. The colors pop in this shot as well.</td>', 'The subject stands out as the background is blurry and the person is sharply in focus. The colors pop in this shot as well.', '2008-03-09 17:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550401, 654234, 49858, '<td valign="top">Perhaps not as sharp as I would have liked it to be.  I''m guessing it was a fairly heavy crop?  Great idea and it works well, made me laugh.  Good title.</td>', 'Perhaps not as sharp as I would have liked it to be.  I''m guessing it was a fairly heavy crop?  Great idea and it works well, made me laugh.  Good title.', '2008-03-09 17:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550403, 654673, 89546, '<td valign="top">Ths sunset is nicely captured, as is its reflection on the water. The colors all pop in this shot.</td>', 'Ths sunset is nicely captured, as is its reflection on the water. The colors all pop in this shot.', '2008-03-09 17:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550404, 654056, 89546, '<td valign="top">This shot is barely tilted, and would have better met the objective if the camera angle was different.</td>', 'This shot is barely tilted, and would have better met the objective if the camera angle was different.', '2008-03-09 17:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550407, 653447, 90380, '<td valign="top">Very beautifully done, but it doesn''t quite illustrate the theme of "tilted" to me.</td>', 'Very beautifully done, but it doesn''t quite illustrate the theme of "tilted" to me.', '2008-03-09 17:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550408, 653420, 89546, '<td valign="top">The shot is exellently captured. The water spashing to the right looks amazing. Cropping closer to the subject would have made the shot better.</td>', 'The shot is exellently captured. The water spashing to the right looks amazing. Cropping closer to the subject would have made the shot better.', '2008-03-09 17:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550411, 653298, 89546, '<td valign="top">The camera angle is very interseting, and the subject fills up just the right amount of space in the shot.</td>', 'The camera angle is very interseting, and the subject fills up just the right amount of space in the shot.', '2008-03-09 17:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550413, 654338, 89546, '<td valign="top">This shot doesnt really meet the objective, the floor is slightly tiltled, but you dont notice it right away. Keeping the cat out of the center of the shot was a good idea though.</td>', 'This shot doesnt really meet the objective, the floor is slightly tiltled, but you dont notice it right away. Keeping the cat out of the center of the shot was a good idea though.', '2008-03-09 17:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550415, 654356, 89546, '<td valign="top">The background is very grainy. The shot would have been better if you had focused on on your subject, and cropped out the background.</td>', 'The background is very grainy. The shot would have been better if you had focused on on your subject, and cropped out the background.', '2008-03-09 17:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550418, 654486, 89546, '<td valign="top">The colors in this photograph really stand out. Cropping in close on the subject makes it interesting.</td>', 'The colors in this photograph really stand out. Cropping in close on the subject makes it interesting.', '2008-03-09 17:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550443, 654376, 49858, '<td valign="top">Good use of tilting the image to help create the illusion.</td>', 'Good use of tilting the image to help create the illusion.', '2008-03-09 17:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550451, 654714, 89546, '<td valign="top">This shot is very interesting, the building is tilting one way, and the fence the other way. The colors in the picture also pop out.</td>', 'This shot is very interesting, the building is tilting one way, and the fence the other way. The colors in the picture also pop out.', '2008-03-09 17:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550453, 654768, 3765, '<td valign="top">This is really a fun shot. Good focus and exposure.</td>', 'This is really a fun shot. Good focus and exposure.', '2008-03-09 17:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550454, 654626, 89546, '<td valign="top">There is too much black in the picture. Focusing in on the orange poles on the side would have made a more intesting shot.</td>', 'There is too much black in the picture. Focusing in on the orange poles on the side would have made a more intesting shot.', '2008-03-09 17:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550456, 653762, 89546, '<td valign="top">This shot doesn''t meet the objective at all. The shot should be tilted, not straight on.</td>', 'This shot doesn''t meet the objective at all. The shot should be tilted, not straight on.', '2008-03-09 17:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550457, 654639, 89546, '<td valign="top">This shot doesn''t meet the objective, as it is taken straight on and should be tilted.</td>', 'This shot doesn''t meet the objective, as it is taken straight on and should be tilted.', '2008-03-09 17:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550459, 654492, 89546, '<td valign="top">The blue and purple background causes the yellow and orange to pop in the flower. The subject placement also makes the shot intersting.</td>', 'The blue and purple background causes the yellow and orange to pop in the flower. The subject placement also makes the shot intersting.', '2008-03-09 17:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550466, 654296, 89546, '<td valign="top">Good choice to put the shot in black and white. The repitition of doorways, and the shadows are very interesting.</td>', 'Good choice to put the shot in black and white. The repitition of doorways, and the shadows are very interesting.', '2008-03-09 17:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550467, 654763, 89546, '<td valign="top">The colors in the shot pop out, and the texture in the waves adds interset to the shot.</td>', 'The colors in the shot pop out, and the texture in the waves adds interset to the shot.', '2008-03-09 17:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550468, 653051, 89546, '<td valign="top">The reflection of the sky in the building is very neat, but there is too much blue in the shot. Cropping out the sky, and having better lighting would make the shot better.</td>', 'The reflection of the sky in the building is very neat, but there is too much blue in the shot. Cropping out the sky, and having better lighting would make the shot better.', '2008-03-09 17:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
