(4550558, 654718, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the variety of lines here, straight, curved, thin, thick... combined with the patterns of black and white.  Very nice!</td>', 'Love the variety of lines here, straight, curved, thin, thick... combined with the patterns of black and white.  Very nice!', '2008-03-09 18:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550559, 654414, 47852, '<td valign="top">Not sure how the tilt adds any impact to this one, except that you were able to get more of the interesting foreground in the shot without having to have an overabundance of it.  Interesting color and textures throughout the landscape too.</td>', 'Not sure how the tilt adds any impact to this one, except that you were able to get more of the interesting foreground in the shot without having to have an overabundance of it.  Interesting color and textures throughout the landscape too.', '2008-03-09 18:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550561, 654661, 47852, '<td valign="top">Not sure that this is tilted enough to make it really have much of an impact on the overall shot.  Interesting contrast of colors with the deep blue and yellow.</td>', 'Not sure that this is tilted enough to make it really have much of an impact on the overall shot.  Interesting contrast of colors with the deep blue and yellow.', '2008-03-09 18:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550564, 654630, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow dof here, though I''m not sure that the tilt feels like it''s enough or does much to impact the photo.  In fact, I think I might have preferred no tilt here except the front to back tilt... it reminds me of the opening credits to Star Wars!</td>', 'I like the shallow dof here, though I''m not sure that the tilt feels like it''s enough or does much to impact the photo.  In fact, I think I might have preferred no tilt here except the front to back tilt... it reminds me of the opening credits to Star Wars!', '2008-03-09 18:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550568, 653327, 47852, '<td valign="top">A perfect building for a challenge like this.  Unique lines which are only thrown into more chaos with a tilt of the camera.</td>', 'A perfect building for a challenge like this.  Unique lines which are only thrown into more chaos with a tilt of the camera.', '2008-03-09 18:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550570, 654631, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great optical illusion you created here with the camera angle.  I like how the shadows point out in front of him, leading him "uphill".</td>', 'Great optical illusion you created here with the camera angle.  I like how the shadows point out in front of him, leading him "uphill".', '2008-03-09 18:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550571, 653605, 47852, '<td valign="top">Fun shot.  I think the tilt here has a nice impact, giving this a fresh and fun feel.  I do wish her hand and head weren''t cut off though.</td>', 'Fun shot.  I think the tilt here has a nice impact, giving this a fresh and fun feel.  I do wish her hand and head weren''t cut off though.', '2008-03-09 18:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550573, 654110, 47852, '<td valign="top">Like the diagonal line created with the balloon strings, and the shallow dof you used.  Lighting seems just a bit harsh.</td>', 'Like the diagonal line created with the balloon strings, and the shallow dof you used.  Lighting seems just a bit harsh.', '2008-03-09 18:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550575, 652327, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the unique angle.. took me a second to get my bearings with this one.  Great use of a shallow dof too.  Well done.</td>', 'Love the unique angle.. took me a second to get my bearings with this one.  Great use of a shallow dof too.  Well done.', '2008-03-09 18:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550576, 654775, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like how the columns are at a variety of angles throughout the frame.. leaning slightly inward to bending outward at the far end of the shot.  Interesting tilts all throughout the picture, and I also like how the lights create a nice soft curve.  I could do without that pole on the right, but sometimes you just have to deal with whatever is there!</td>', 'I like how the columns are at a variety of angles throughout the frame.. leaning slightly inward to bending outward at the far end of the shot.  Interesting tilts all throughout the picture, and I also like how the lights create a nice soft curve.  I could do without that pole on the right, but sometimes you just have to deal with whatever is there!', '2008-03-09 18:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550579, 654651, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like the way the tilt has let you fill the frame with the subject.  The lighting seems a bit harsh here though, leaving spots of glare and shadows.</td>', 'I like the way the tilt has let you fill the frame with the subject.  The lighting seems a bit harsh here though, leaving spots of glare and shadows.', '2008-03-09 18:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550583, 654380, 47852, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what this is, or how it''s really tilted, but I love the colors and shapes here.  The soft primary colors in the background, with the green shape emerging... interesting!</td>', 'I don''t know what this is, or how it''s really tilted, but I love the colors and shapes here.  The soft primary colors in the background, with the green shape emerging... interesting!', '2008-03-09 19:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550584, 654252, 47852, '<td valign="top">Wow.. quite an explosion of colors!  I have no idea what this is, but it''s interesting.  I love how the lines in the background appear broken and offset with the diagonal lines overtop.  Great illusion!</td>', 'Wow.. quite an explosion of colors!  I have no idea what this is, but it''s interesting.  I love how the lines in the background appear broken and offset with the diagonal lines overtop.  Great illusion!', '2008-03-09 19:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550586, 654632, 47852, '<td valign="top">Looks like an inverted image of a fence, taken from close up.  Nice depth created here with just the black and white.</td>', 'Looks like an inverted image of a fence, taken from close up.  Nice depth created here with just the black and white.', '2008-03-09 19:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550587, 654700, 47852, '<td valign="top">Ahh, I''m always pleased to see people take the risk of entering shots like this.  A beautiful combination of lines and colors, and it certainly has a tilt.  Wonderful!</td>', 'Ahh, I''m always pleased to see people take the risk of entering shots like this.  A beautiful combination of lines and colors, and it certainly has a tilt.  Wonderful!', '2008-03-09 19:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550589, 654783, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great use of tilt here to give a sense of movement.   Nicely done!</td>', 'Great use of tilt here to give a sense of movement.   Nicely done!', '2008-03-09 19:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550604, 653784, 47852, '<td valign="top">The tilt here gives this photo an extra boost of fun and movement.  Nicely handled movement and dof.</td>', 'The tilt here gives this photo an extra boost of fun and movement.  Nicely handled movement and dof.', '2008-03-09 19:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550605, 654427, 47852, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the use of tilt here, but I definitely love the lines created by the ice, waves, water and birds.  I suppose tilting allowed you to show more of those in more detail though, so it worked to your advantage.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the use of tilt here, but I definitely love the lines created by the ice, waves, water and birds.  I suppose tilting allowed you to show more of those in more detail though, so it worked to your advantage.', '2008-03-09 19:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
