(4551965, 654444, 36167, '<td valign="top">Superb! Great composition, great lighting. <br/> <br/>Letting the model twist her body inside the twisted camera angle while keeping her head in a "normal" position is brilliant: Focusses attention on her face. Which makes the expression, tilted glasses and index finger even more powerful. Finally her leg in the air is a great compliment to the rest of the action. Like an exclamtion mark!<br/> <br/>Highest praise!</td>', 'Superb! Great composition, great lighting.  Letting the model twist her body inside the twisted camera angle while keeping her head in a "normal" position is brilliant: Focusses attention on her face. Which makes the expression, tilted glasses and index finger even more powerful. Finally her leg in the air is a great compliment to the rest of the action. Like an exclamtion mark! Highest praise!', '2008-03-10 10:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4551967, 654444, 89426, '<td valign="top">The angle that you captured this image in works well. There is a lot of great values and contrast.</td>', 'The angle that you captured this image in works well. There is a lot of great values and contrast.', '2008-03-10 10:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4551969, 654429, 89426, '<td valign="top">I like the angle that you captured. There is a lot of great shadows that you created, the dog is a good model.</td>', 'I like the angle that you captured. There is a lot of great shadows that you created, the dog is a good model.', '2008-03-10 10:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4551971, 654594, 89426, '<td valign="top">I like this subject. The lines are great, there is so much movement.</td>', 'I like this subject. The lines are great, there is so much movement.', '2008-03-10 10:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4551975, 654474, 36167, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Angle and curved, colored lights really add to the feeling of speed and cornering.</td>', 'Good composition. Angle and curved, colored lights really add to the feeling of speed and cornering.', '2008-03-10 10:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4551978, 654252, 89426, '<td valign="top">I like this image. There are great colors and lines. There are a lot of different angles of lines so it works well with this shoot. Nice job.</td>', 'I like this image. There are great colors and lines. There are a lot of different angles of lines so it works well with this shoot. Nice job.', '2008-03-10 10:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4551979, 653902, 36167, '<td valign="top">Good photo, but why here?</td>', 'Good photo, but why here?', '2008-03-10 10:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4551980, 654066, 89426, '<td valign="top">You captured a nice angle. This is a plain but beautiful picture. The natural colors work well tgether.</td>', 'You captured a nice angle. This is a plain but beautiful picture. The natural colors work well tgether.', '2008-03-10 10:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4551984, 653596, 36167, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Birds shape against the edge of the photo works well with challenge, but the color and lighting is the fantastic part of the photo. Well done!</td>', 'Excellent. Birds shape against the edge of the photo works well with challenge, but the color and lighting is the fantastic part of the photo. Well done!', '2008-03-10 10:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552017, 654252, 36167, '<td valign="top">Great!</td>', 'Great!', '2008-03-10 10:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552058, 653440, 55005, '<td valign="top">What''s not to like here?  Beautiful low key, a very nice model.  :)  The elbow in the top left and the head are a little too soft for me, though.  One of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'What''s not to like here?  Beautiful low key, a very nice model.  :)  The elbow in the top left and the head are a little too soft for me, though.  One of my favorites in this challenge.', '2008-03-10 11:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552061, 653374, 55005, '<td valign="top">The fly is so sharp that it is actually kind of painful to look at. :) Great job.</td>', 'The fly is so sharp that it is actually kind of painful to look at. :) Great job.', '2008-03-10 11:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552065, 653468, 55005, '<td valign="top">The tilt works so well here. I especially love the frozen water. One of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'The tilt works so well here. I especially love the frozen water. One of my favorites in this challenge.', '2008-03-10 11:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552071, 654107, 55005, '<td valign="top">I love the tones here.  Very itneresting, I love the leading lines and the contrast between the wood and the water ripples.  Well done.</td>', 'I love the tones here.  Very itneresting, I love the leading lines and the contrast between the wood and the water ripples.  Well done.', '2008-03-10 11:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552118, 654252, 55005, '<td valign="top">Very creative take on the challenge. Love the bright colors.</td>', 'Very creative take on the challenge. Love the bright colors.', '2008-03-10 11:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552121, 654756, 55005, '<td valign="top">Charming model. Looks like he is smiling, too. Wonderful capture, his fur looks a bit oversharpened, though.</td>', 'Charming model. Looks like he is smiling, too. Wonderful capture, his fur looks a bit oversharpened, though.', '2008-03-10 11:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552123, 654545, 55005, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast here.  Very dramatic.</td>', 'I love the contrast here.  Very dramatic.', '2008-03-10 11:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552128, 653447, 55005, '<td valign="top">This is one really beautiful image, although I don''t see an unusual angle I''d expect from in a "Tilted" challenge.  The glare in the top right corner is a little distracting.</td>', 'This is one really beautiful image, although I don''t see an unusual angle I''d expect from in a "Tilted" challenge.  The glare in the top right corner is a little distracting.', '2008-03-10 11:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552134, 654594, 55005, '<td valign="top">Love your title. So fitting the image.  I love all these repetitive lines, they do remind me of piano keys. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Love your title. So fitting the image.  I love all these repetitive lines, they do remind me of piano keys. One of my favorites.', '2008-03-10 11:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552158, 654714, 85832, '<td valign="top">finally, something thats tilted on its own with having the camera level!!! nice eye</td>', 'finally, something thats tilted on its own with having the camera level!!! nice eye', '2008-03-10 12:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552162, 654444, 85832, '<td valign="top">yeah, i get it, model is worth a ten all on her own</td>', 'yeah, i get it, model is worth a ten all on her own', '2008-03-10 12:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552189, 653898, 58452, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, grids and lines distorted by the fish-eye. I think if you''d centered the vanishing point exactly on the 45 degree mark it would have made a better composition. I still like it a lot.  Congrats.</td>', 'I like the colors, grids and lines distorted by the fish-eye. I think if you''d centered the vanishing point exactly on the 45 degree mark it would have made a better composition. I still like it a lot.  Congrats.', '2008-03-10 12:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552194, 653833, 58452, '<td valign="top">Wish this could have been a head on shot where faces were visible. Also the background is a bit cluttered and detracts from your subject. Still a nice trapeze action shot. Now.  Will they tack or jibe? Interesting image. I''d jibe.</td>', 'Wish this could have been a head on shot where faces were visible. Also the background is a bit cluttered and detracts from your subject. Still a nice trapeze action shot. Now.  Will they tack or jibe? Interesting image. I''d jibe.', '2008-03-10 12:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552287, 654376, 90495, '<td valign="top">Well photographed balancing act. I like it for some strange reason.</td>', 'Well photographed balancing act. I like it for some strange reason.', '2008-03-10 13:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552294, 653596, 90495, '<td valign="top">Good capture and great colours on that bird.</td>', 'Good capture and great colours on that bird.', '2008-03-10 13:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552298, 653920, 90495, '<td valign="top">I''ll give you credit for aligning the side of the roof with the top border. It makes for an interesting image.</td>', 'I''ll give you credit for aligning the side of the roof with the top border. It makes for an interesting image.', '2008-03-10 13:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552305, 653397, 90495, '<td valign="top">Boom! It works for me. 8</td>', 'Boom! It works for me. 8', '2008-03-10 13:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552307, 654344, 90495, '<td valign="top">Nice curvy lines and that slight angle gives it all movement.</td>', 'Nice curvy lines and that slight angle gives it all movement.', '2008-03-10 13:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552349, 654675, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like the blue shade and the way the liquid refracts the background. Picked up a little jaggies in the resize to 640, but not a lot you can do for that other than play with resizing methods.</td>', 'Nice. I like the blue shade and the way the liquid refracts the background. Picked up a little jaggies in the resize to 640, but not a lot you can do for that other than play with resizing methods.', '2008-03-10 13:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552351, 654714, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like it would make a marvelous "clubhouse".  Maybe composing the view from a slightly different angle, closer to the fence, or lower to the ground, would improve it a touch, but not sure.</td>', 'Looks like it would make a marvelous "clubhouse".  Maybe composing the view from a slightly different angle, closer to the fence, or lower to the ground, would improve it a touch, but not sure.', '2008-03-10 13:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552358, 653447, 83313, '<td valign="top">Curious why this is "going nowhere". Would whoever lives on the other side be insulted? Reminds me of my dad. If he was looking at me and I said "what are you looking at?", He would respond: "Just staring into space." Ok, I suppose that''s not really related in any way...<br/> <br/>I''d call this more of a perspective view that a tilt, but it''s pretty good. -1 notch for lack of tilt.</td>', 'Curious why this is "going nowhere". Would whoever lives on the other side be insulted? Reminds me of my dad. If he was looking at me and I said "what are you looking at?", He would respond: "Just staring into space." Ok, I suppose that''s not really related in any way... I''d call this more of a perspective view that a tilt, but it''s pretty good. -1 notch for lack of tilt.', '2008-03-10 13:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552361, 653840, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I can''t even figure out what is going on above water, it''s so blown out. The tilt does not seem to add anything to this.</td>', 'I''m afraid I can''t even figure out what is going on above water, it''s so blown out. The tilt does not seem to add anything to this.', '2008-03-10 13:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552367, 654775, 83313, '<td valign="top">Makes me feel like I''ve had just a couple too many. (That was a compliment on the effective use of the tilt, BTW.)</td>', 'Makes me feel like I''ve had just a couple too many. (That was a compliment on the effective use of the tilt, BTW.)', '2008-03-10 13:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552369, 654292, 83313, '<td valign="top">Almost a postcard shot. I''m not sure if the tilt adds anything to this for me.</td>', 'Almost a postcard shot. I''m not sure if the tilt adds anything to this for me.', '2008-03-10 13:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552373, 654372, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice. Swoopy clouds and steep perspectives always do well.</td>', 'Nice. Swoopy clouds and steep perspectives always do well.', '2008-03-10 13:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552383, 654513, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not a lot of tilt here, and the perspective is a bit distorted. Otherwise, the quality of the shot itself is good.</td>', 'Not a lot of tilt here, and the perspective is a bit distorted. Otherwise, the quality of the shot itself is good.', '2008-03-10 13:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552390, 654444, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this, though I am not sure what she is in. Looks like a giant ashtray or something. Must be sculpture. I''d also like to know what the title is referring to. I assume it means it is just past the end of the workday.</td>', 'I like this, though I am not sure what she is in. Looks like a giant ashtray or something. Must be sculpture. I''d also like to know what the title is referring to. I assume it means it is just past the end of the workday.', '2008-03-10 13:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552396, 654369, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good effort at using tilt to try and add interest, but it falls a little short, I''m afraid. I also take pictures out my car window. Sometimes I get something interesting, more often not. Fun to try though.</td>', 'I think this is a good effort at using tilt to try and add interest, but it falls a little short, I''m afraid. I also take pictures out my car window. Sometimes I get something interesting, more often not. Fun to try though.', '2008-03-10 13:51:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4552542, 653801, 36981, '<td valign="top">Oh, I love this one.  It''s beautiful.</td>', 'Oh, I love this one.  It''s beautiful.', '2008-03-10 15:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552552, 654252, 88923, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!.  Love the colours and lines.  It really shows the tilt without just tilting the camera.</td>', 'Fantastic!.  Love the colours and lines.  It really shows the tilt without just tilting the camera.', '2008-03-10 15:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552556, 654325, 88923, '<td valign="top">Impressive.  Done in excellent taste.  You did not just tilt the camera (though it is made to appear like that), because of the liquid in the glass being flat horizontal.  I would be interested to hear how you did this.</td>', 'Impressive.  Done in excellent taste.  You did not just tilt the camera (though it is made to appear like that), because of the liquid in the glass being flat horizontal.  I would be interested to hear how you did this.', '2008-03-10 15:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552579, 654675, 88923, '<td valign="top">Great expressions of tilted from the glass, the liquid, the background.  Good job.</td>', 'Great expressions of tilted from the glass, the liquid, the background.  Good job.', '2008-03-10 15:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552584, 653347, 90495, '<td valign="top">This works for me. It''s a basic tilt of the camera but it has effect in this type of shot. Maybe it''s the tight crop. Good entry.</td>', 'This works for me. It''s a basic tilt of the camera but it has effect in this type of shot. Maybe it''s the tight crop. Good entry.', '2008-03-10 15:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552586, 654376, 88923, '<td valign="top">Well done.  How''d did you get the eggs (and spoons) to cooperate?</td>', 'Well done.  How''d did you get the eggs (and spoons) to cooperate?', '2008-03-10 15:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552626, 653422, 5364, '<td valign="top">I feel you might have been better getting closer and therefore removing the edges - so you just had the balls filling the image. Nice interpretation though.</td>', 'I feel you might have been better getting closer and therefore removing the edges - so you just had the balls filling the image. Nice interpretation though.', '2008-03-10 15:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552645, 654666, 5364, '<td valign="top">It''s a great idea, but I feel your subject is rather camouflaged against the trees.</td>', 'It''s a great idea, but I feel your subject is rather camouflaged against the trees.', '2008-03-10 15:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552699, 654436, 90495, '<td valign="top">This works nicely. The mountain range along with the horizon line separating the water and land. Beautiful calm day and it shows in this tilted version.<br/>The bottle... I don''t know</td>', 'This works nicely. The mountain range along with the horizon line separating the water and land. Beautiful calm day and it shows in this tilted version.The bottle... I don''t know', '2008-03-10 16:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552715, 653851, 90495, '<td valign="top">Lots of tilts and lots of colour. All were nicely exposed. That empty space to the left is kinda boring but I know you wanted to keep the contrails so I understand why it''s there.</td>', 'Lots of tilts and lots of colour. All were nicely exposed. That empty space to the left is kinda boring but I know you wanted to keep the contrails so I understand why it''s there.', '2008-03-10 16:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552726, 653798, 90495, '<td valign="top">This would have effect even if the camera weren''t tilted.</td>', 'This would have effect even if the camera weren''t tilted.', '2008-03-10 16:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552742, 654653, 90495, '<td valign="top">I do not think the tilt was necessary to achieve what you wanted. Good exposure.</td>', 'I do not think the tilt was necessary to achieve what you wanted. Good exposure.', '2008-03-10 16:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552752, 653770, 90495, '<td valign="top">I like the strong angles in this and the colours work. Good job!</td>', 'I like the strong angles in this and the colours work. Good job!', '2008-03-10 16:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552918, 654650, 88923, '<td valign="top">Great acting by the character.  This photo has a lot of movement because of him.</td>', 'Great acting by the character.  This photo has a lot of movement because of him.', '2008-03-10 17:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552920, 653616, 88923, '<td valign="top">Fantastic close-up and wonderful detail in this shot.</td>', 'Fantastic close-up and wonderful detail in this shot.', '2008-03-10 17:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4552922, 654435, 88923, '<td valign="top">Great shop and good idea.</td>', 'Great shop and good idea.', '2008-03-10 17:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553066, 654244, 6999, '<td valign="top">The implications of this in this challenge are shattering: if only one were able to believe that they might have had some pertenence in reality! Still, nice photo of a duck.</td>', 'The implications of this in this challenge are shattering: if only one were able to believe that they might have had some pertenence in reality! Still, nice photo of a duck.', '2008-03-10 18:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553180, 653898, 25355, '<td valign="top">Marunouchi Line?<br/>You''ve handled the lighting well; it looks clean and bright.</td>', 'Marunouchi Line?You''ve handled the lighting well; it looks clean and bright.', '2008-03-10 19:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553212, 654752, 25355, '<td valign="top">I think it''s convex. No, wait a minute - concave. No - convex. Ah, conca... aaaagh! Going crazy here....</td>', 'I think it''s convex. No, wait a minute - concave. No - convex. Ah, conca... aaaagh! Going crazy here....', '2008-03-10 19:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553255, 653784, 57777, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field and angle. Definately makes you feel like you are part of some big turn he is making. Very technically solid. A little dark and soft in the eyes, but a good shot!</td>', 'Nice depth of field and angle. Definately makes you feel like you are part of some big turn he is making. Very technically solid. A little dark and soft in the eyes, but a good shot!', '2008-03-10 20:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553257, 654244, 57777, '<td valign="top">good shot, nice angle, but doesnt seem tilted. Techincally very solid.</td>', 'good shot, nice angle, but doesnt seem tilted. Techincally very solid.', '2008-03-10 20:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553259, 654376, 57777, '<td valign="top">interesting... Guessing black plexiglass. I think that its a tad underexposed. Your whites are still kinda grey. Good shit, but needs just a bit more work imho</td>', 'interesting... Guessing black plexiglass. I think that its a tad underexposed. Your whites are still kinda grey. Good shit, but needs just a bit more work imho', '2008-03-10 20:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553260, 653770, 57777, '<td valign="top">cool angle. It looks like there are possibly two chairs stacked on eachother here, but its hard to tell. If so, I think even a lower angle, or wider angle would have worked more. Very creative</td>', 'cool angle. It looks like there are possibly two chairs stacked on eachother here, but its hard to tell. If so, I think even a lower angle, or wider angle would have worked more. Very creative', '2008-03-10 20:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553267, 653347, 57777, '<td valign="top">Its a fine shot, but to me, things have to have somewhat of a reason to be tilted, and this one really doesnt. Good use of lines, I just wish that they led somewhere a little more interesting.</td>', 'Its a fine shot, but to me, things have to have somewhat of a reason to be tilted, and this one really doesnt. Good use of lines, I just wish that they led somewhere a little more interesting.', '2008-03-10 20:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553271, 653046, 57777, '<td valign="top">This is just wierd!!! First, I gotta wonder about the basic editing part of this... Its a little hot in the corner with the cat, doesnt really "glow"like I think you were going for. The strong thing about this photo: Makes me really wanna know whats going on!</td>', 'This is just wierd!!! First, I gotta wonder about the basic editing part of this... Its a little hot in the corner with the cat, doesnt really "glow"like I think you were going for. The strong thing about this photo: Makes me really wanna know whats going on!', '2008-03-10 20:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553273, 653979, 57777, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and use of lines. Everything looks very soft and pleasing to the eye. Nice work</td>', 'Beautiful color and use of lines. Everything looks very soft and pleasing to the eye. Nice work', '2008-03-10 20:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553276, 653417, 57777, '<td valign="top">To dark in some areas, and flat in others. The bricks dont have much of a texture, and you cant see enough of the lamp as it is lost in shaddow. More contrast would also help</td>', 'To dark in some areas, and flat in others. The bricks dont have much of a texture, and you cant see enough of the lamp as it is lost in shaddow. More contrast would also help', '2008-03-10 20:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553280, 653331, 57777, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, and wow I want to visit that beach. GREAT colors, and great time to shoot, the clouds are even perfect. Nice work. Still early into voting, but one of the better so far!</td>', 'Beautiful picture, and wow I want to visit that beach. GREAT colors, and great time to shoot, the clouds are even perfect. Nice work. Still early into voting, but one of the better so far!', '2008-03-10 20:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553285, 654447, 57777, '<td valign="top">Love the headline, but unfortunately, this photo is just way to busy for me. I dont really know where to look first, as the motion catches my eyes, but so do the banners in the middle of the white curve. Great idea, just needed better execution. Keep the headline tho</td>', 'Love the headline, but unfortunately, this photo is just way to busy for me. I dont really know where to look first, as the motion catches my eyes, but so do the banners in the middle of the white curve. Great idea, just needed better execution. Keep the headline tho', '2008-03-10 20:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553287, 654436, 57777, '<td valign="top">Great angle, beautiful location, but just a bit dark in the corner and right around the bottle for me. Also, around the edge of the cork (may be due to darkness) seems a bit sof.... Love the idea and picture, worth working on. Still, 7</td>', 'Great angle, beautiful location, but just a bit dark in the corner and right around the bottle for me. Also, around the edge of the cork (may be due to darkness) seems a bit sof.... Love the idea and picture, worth working on. Still, 7', '2008-03-10 20:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553289, 654499, 57777, '<td valign="top">Beautiful building, but dont see "tilted"here at all... Everything looks very straight and symmetrical. Also, the person is just in a wierd place, wierd pose. Wait till their gone next time!</td>', 'Beautiful building, but dont see "tilted"here at all... Everything looks very straight and symmetrical. Also, the person is just in a wierd place, wierd pose. Wait till their gone next time!', '2008-03-10 20:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553291, 652947, 57777, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, great colors and framing. Doesnt seem tilted to me. Nice model pose... wierd that there is no reflection in the water. Good shot still.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, great colors and framing. Doesnt seem tilted to me. Nice model pose... wierd that there is no reflection in the water. Good shot still.', '2008-03-10 20:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553294, 653327, 57777, '<td valign="top">Interesting building, good colors and textures, but nothing very interesting to look at. I know its a tilted challenge, but I feel that part of that is finding something that photographs better being tilted. I just dont see any reason to use this. Technically solid, good exposure and all.</td>', 'Interesting building, good colors and textures, but nothing very interesting to look at. I know its a tilted challenge, but I feel that part of that is finding something that photographs better being tilted. I just dont see any reason to use this. Technically solid, good exposure and all.', '2008-03-10 20:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553297, 653898, 57777, '<td valign="top">love the colors, lines, motion and lens. Reminds me of a mcdonalds with the color. Technically good, but just needs that one element (dont know what though) to really make it pop</td>', 'love the colors, lines, motion and lens. Reminds me of a mcdonalds with the color. Technically good, but just needs that one element (dont know what though) to really make it pop', '2008-03-10 20:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553299, 654661, 57777, '<td valign="top">not really tilted enough, Also very dark, and needs more texture. Perhaps braketing your shots a bit more would help.</td>', 'not really tilted enough, Also very dark, and needs more texture. Perhaps braketing your shots a bit more would help.', '2008-03-10 20:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553301, 654775, 57777, '<td valign="top">I think that the location of the metal pole on the right is a bit distracting. I think that hugging the beams, and using more telephoto to compact them together would have helped this shot a lot</td>', 'I think that the location of the metal pole on the right is a bit distracting. I think that hugging the beams, and using more telephoto to compact them together would have helped this shot a lot', '2008-03-10 20:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
