(4553799, 654774, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Unfortunately, it comes off as a casual snapshot, which it probably is. Some adjustment of white balance and curves might make a noticeable difference in this.</td>', 'Very cute. Unfortunately, it comes off as a casual snapshot, which it probably is. Some adjustment of white balance and curves might make a noticeable difference in this.', '2008-03-10 23:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553802, 653898, 48697, '<td valign="top">Love it! Great color and awsome composition with the fisheye. Love the motion blur as well, well done, one of my favorites!</td>', 'Love it! Great color and awsome composition with the fisheye. Love the motion blur as well, well done, one of my favorites!', '2008-03-10 23:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553804, 654429, 48697, '<td valign="top">lol, nice! I love how it looks like he is staring at the ball waiting for you pick it up and throw it, nicely done!</td>', 'lol, nice! I love how it looks like he is staring at the ball waiting for you pick it up and throw it, nicely done!', '2008-03-10 23:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553806, 653979, 48697, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''m sliding off!, nice pic.</td>', 'I feel like I''m sliding off!, nice pic.', '2008-03-10 23:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553812, 654602, 48697, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit over sharpened as I can see sharpening halos on the outlines.</td>', 'This looks a bit over sharpened as I can see sharpening halos on the outlines.', '2008-03-10 23:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553813, 654788, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the subdued colors in this and the partial silhouette of the cat. There is quite a bit of jagginess visible in the grass. You may want to try a different resizing method, some of them will give smoother results than others. Also, you only used 590 pixels for your image, when it could have been up to 640. Also watch your JPEG compression settings. Using all the available pixel size and file size will help maximize the detail in your entries.</td>', 'I like the subdued colors in this and the partial silhouette of the cat. There is quite a bit of jagginess visible in the grass. You may want to try a different resizing method, some of them will give smoother results than others. Also, you only used 590 pixels for your image, when it could have been up to 640. Also watch your JPEG compression settings. Using all the available pixel size and file size will help maximize the detail in your entries.', '2008-03-10 23:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553826, 654626, 48697, '<td valign="top">i really like the lit up beams, though would have prefered to see them be a bit more the focal point in the compositon.</td>', 'i really like the lit up beams, though would have prefered to see them be a bit more the focal point in the compositon.', '2008-03-10 23:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
