(4554113, 654486, 31535, '<td valign="top">This could have been a great photo, but the hotspots on her nose and the direct shadows under her nose and chin ruin things. This was caused by the onboard flash. Try taking the same shot, without a flash and place your model next to a window. The different will be night and day.</td>', 'This could have been a great photo, but the hotspots on her nose and the direct shadows under her nose and chin ruin things. This was caused by the onboard flash. Try taking the same shot, without a flash and place your model next to a window. The different will be night and day.', '2008-03-11 01:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
