(4554128, 653551, 31535, '<td valign="top">Really clean and sharp. The crop is too close in the bottom right corner. The crane leads my eyes to that corner and out of the frame. Try cropping tight to the top left corner if you can and leave some sky to the right.</td>', 'Really clean and sharp. The crop is too close in the bottom right corner. The crane leads my eyes to that corner and out of the frame. Try cropping tight to the top left corner if you can and leave some sky to the right.', '2008-03-11 02:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
