(4556995, 653919, 45475, '<td valign="top">I thought this was very clever (both concept and delivery) and gave it an 8. For some strange reason, toy shots do not fair that well at DPC. Maybe it''s perceived as the easy way out? I don''t know.<br/> <br/>Good luck with future challenges!<br/> <br/><i>To infinity... and beyond!</i></td>', 'I thought this was very clever (both concept and delivery) and gave it an 8. For some strange reason, toy shots do not fair that well at DPC. Maybe it''s perceived as the easy way out? I don''t know. Good luck with future challenges! To infinity... and beyond!', '2008-03-12 03:31:28.000000', NULL, 0),
