(4557085, 654769, 40289, '<td valign="top">thanks for those who voted on this and left comments.<br/> <br/>too bad i missed the email for a validation request since i was too busy with work =(<br/> <br/>actually spencerwood, there was no dodging and burning done on this photo. most of the work was done in lightroom just fiddling around with the sliders. the only thing done is photoshop was unsharp masks.<br/> <br/>again, thanks for the votes and comments. =) this was my first ever submission and even though it was DQ''ed, it''s very encouraging to submit again.</td>', 'thanks for those who voted on this and left comments. too bad i missed the email for a validation request since i was too busy with work =( actually spencerwood, there was no dodging and burning done on this photo. most of the work was done in lightroom just fiddling around with the sliders. the only thing done is photoshop was unsharp masks. again, thanks for the votes and comments. =) this was my first ever submission and even though it was DQ''ed, it''s very encouraging to submit again.', '2008-03-12 05:20:39.000000', NULL, 0),
