(4557449, 653770, 89468, '<td valign="top">Thank you all. As you may have noticed I am new here so I appreciate the comments.<br/> <br/>Yes there were two chairs and yes the blur in the bottom was planned. I planned it to make the cookie jar more obvious but now I realise it makes no sense to show a kid point of view where what is closed to him is blur !! Thanks for questionning it.<br/> <br/>For the title, I meant it as if the child says that he can make it but say it in a way that tell he is not so sure. I obviously failed if people think I made a syntax mistake... <br/> <br/>Those who think a cookie jar is not interesting... have never tasted my cookies ;) <br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-12 09:08:39.</i></td>', 'Thank you all. As you may have noticed I am new here so I appreciate the comments. Yes there were two chairs and yes the blur in the bottom was planned. I planned it to make the cookie jar more obvious but now I realise it makes no sense to show a kid point of view where what is closed to him is blur !! Thanks for questionning it. For the title, I meant it as if the child says that he can make it but say it in a way that tell he is not so sure. I obviously failed if people think I made a syntax mistake...  Those who think a cookie jar is not interesting... have never tasted my cookies ;)  ', '2008-03-12 09:00:19.000000', '2008-03-12 09:08:39.000000', 0),
