(4575727, 654602, 34462, '<td valign="top">Love the colors of the chimneys against the sky and the textures of the brick. I kind of like the antenna as it adds a quirkiness, like a little cow-lick for the rooftop.<br/></td>', 'Love the colors of the chimneys against the sky and the textures of the brick. I kind of like the antenna as it adds a quirkiness, like a little cow-lick for the rooftop.', '2008-03-19 23:40:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586140, 654489, 23002, '<td valign="top">I have always liked the way you manage to see things in a way that is totally different then I would have.  I did not enter this challenge, but I am sure if I had, I would have been looking for some natural tilt, and it would not have been nearly as effective as this is.  Nicely seen.</td>', 'I have always liked the way you manage to see things in a way that is totally different then I would have.  I did not enter this challenge, but I am sure if I had, I would have been looking for some natural tilt, and it would not have been nearly as effective as this is.  Nicely seen.', '2008-03-25 16:02:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586145, 654661, 23002, '<td valign="top">Great colour saturation, almost too much for me, but likely about right for dpc entries. :)  I think perhaps a lower perspective on this would make it more powerful.  Oh, and since I grew up in farm country, I picked up on the Massey Ferguson from the title.</td>', 'Great colour saturation, almost too much for me, but likely about right for dpc entries. :)  I think perhaps a lower perspective on this would make it more powerful.  Oh, and since I grew up in farm country, I picked up on the Massey Ferguson from the title.', '2008-03-25 16:05:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586148, 652272, 23002, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of composition, with the tree trunk coming into frame from the bottom left.  It is a great silohoutte. (I really wish we had spell check on here...)</td>', 'I like your choice of composition, with the tree trunk coming into frame from the bottom left.  It is a great silohoutte. (I really wish we had spell check on here...)', '2008-03-25 16:07:10.000000', NULL, 0),
