(4586253, 653606, 23002, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  I love the idea, and I like the processing right up to the point where it gets a greenish tinge to it.  If it was a straight greyscale it would work better for me. I like the uniqueness of it.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  I love the idea, and I like the processing right up to the point where it gets a greenish tinge to it.  If it was a straight greyscale it would work better for me. I like the uniqueness of it.', '2008-03-25 16:41:46.000000', NULL, 0),
